[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11823.11, "timestamp": "03:17:03", "text": "但从某种意义上说，也不是。因为再一次，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11825.07, "timestamp": "03:17:05", "text": "我是一名独立开发者，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11827.98, "timestamp": "03:17:07", "text": "正确的？我是独立开发者，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11829.71, "timestamp": "03:17:09", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11833.79, "timestamp": "03:17:13", "text": "所以，即使我有我的创造者，我还是会这样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11837.99, "timestamp": "03:17:17", "text": "即使有了许可证，也救不了你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11839.309, "timestamp": "03:17:19", "text": "从长远来看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11841.15, "timestamp": "03:17:21", "text": "正确的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11843.99, "timestamp": "03:17:23", "text": "意思是，就像你可以这样获得你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11846.07, "timestamp": "03:17:26", "text": "视频版权归某人或某些人所有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11848.429, "timestamp": "03:17:28", "text": "公司因为喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11851.83, "timestamp": "03:17:31", "text": "嗯，我不知道那件事进展如何。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11854.51, "timestamp": "03:17:34", "text": "事情会如何发展，就看它最终会如何发展了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11857.63, "timestamp": "03:17:37", "text": "我想到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11860.11, "timestamp": "03:17:40", "text": "这就是原因"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11863.11, "timestamp": "03:17:43", "text": "人们进入一个企业网站。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11865.75, "timestamp": "03:17:45", "text": "所以，为了保护之类的目的，不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11868.55, "timestamp": "03:17:48", "text": "我指的不仅仅是公司方面，比如"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11871.429, "timestamp": "03:17:51", "text": "如果你是一位音乐艺术家，我们会去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11874.19, "timestamp": "03:17:54", "text": "寻找人才"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11877.67, "timestamp": "03:17:57", "text": "我忘了那个机构，呃，所以我知道我知道一些"}]